-- Creature melee base damage per second (levels 1-85) from the client game tables NpcDamageByClass, NpcDamageByClassExp1,
-- NpcDamageByClassExp2 and NpcDamageByClassExp3 (identical in the Cataclysm Classic and Mists of Pandaria Classic clients;
-- the tables TrinityCore uses). creature_classlevelstats basehp0-3 already equal NpcTotalHp; the damage columns held
-- older reconstructed values (1.2-8x lower below level 60, ~14x lower for expansion 3 at level 85).
-- Levels 86-90: the expansion 0-3 columns held per-hit copies of damage_exp4; they become damage_exp4 / 2 (per second
-- at a 2.0 s swing), so those creatures keep hitting as hard as before.
